{"seq":8,"slug":"indie-product-analytics","title":"独立产品的数据分析","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","categoryLabel":"独立开发与上架","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 独立产品的数据分析 简介\n\n要用数据改进产品，独立开发者需要的不是复杂的分析体系，而是少数对的、能驱动决策的指标，加上对小样本数据的清醒认识。本 hub 面向想用数据做好产品决策的独立开发者，从分析工具栈（隐私友好的分析、该测量什么、避免过度埋点）讲起，覆盖事件埋点（事件分类法、漏斗测量、把埋点做好）、重要的指标（北极星与漏斗、收入指标、虚荣 vs 可行动），以及从数据做决策（小样本下的决策、量化加质化、数据知情而非数据驱动）。它聚焦分析/测量的手艺与小团队的决策方式，与「留存」hub 的留存指标互补。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：测量服务于决策而非越多越好、用隐私友好工具和数据最小化、盯可行动指标避免虚荣与虚假精确、用质化补充小样本量化——并以「数据知情而非数据驱动」的成熟态度，让数据增强而非取代判断与愿景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analytics-stack","title":"Analytics Stack","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"privacy-friendly-analytics","title":"隐私友好的分析","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/privacy-friendly-analytics","wordCount":2036,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-to-measure","title":"该测量什么","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/what-to-measure","wordCount":1813,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoid-over-instrumenting","title":"避免过度埋点","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/analytics-stack/avoid-over-instrumenting","wordCount":1989,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲分析工具栈：用隐私友好的分析（Plausible/PostHog）在获得需要的洞察的同时尊重隐私与数据最小化、围绕核心健康（激活/留存/收入/漏斗）选少数能驱动决策的指标该测量什么，以及避免过度埋点（少即是多——只埋能驱动决策的关键事件）。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-instrumentation","title":"Event Instrumentation","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-taxonomy","title":"事件分类法","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/event-taxonomy","wordCount":1852,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"funnel-measurement","title":"漏斗测量","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/funnel-measurement","wordCount":1983,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"instrumenting-well","title":"把埋点做好","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/event-instrumentation/instrumenting-well","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲事件埋点：用一致、描述性、围绕用户旅程组织的事件分类法让数据清晰可用、用漏斗测量精确定位用户在哪一步流失、以及把埋点做准做对（在正确时机触发、不重不漏、处理边界、验证它真的工作）——错误的数据比没有更危险。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-that-matter","title":"Metrics That Matter","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"north-star-and-funnel","title":"北极星与漏斗指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/north-star-and-funnel","wordCount":2046,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"revenue-metrics","title":"收入指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/revenue-metrics","wordCount":1818,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"vanity-vs-actionable","title":"虚荣指标与可行动指标","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/metrics-that-matter/vanity-vs-actionable","wordCount":2022,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲重要的指标：用「北极星+漏斗」框架（北极星给方向、漏斗给抓手）保持焦点、盯反映生意真实健康与可持续的收入指标（尤其 LTV vs CAC 的单位经济），以及区分虚荣指标（好看只增不减不驱动行动）与可行动指标（比率/质量、反映真实健康、指引行动）。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"deciding-from-data","title":"Deciding From Data","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"small-sample-decisions","title":"小样本下的决策","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/small-sample-decisions","wordCount":2192,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"quant-plus-qual","title":"量化加质化","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/quant-plus-qual","wordCount":2118,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-informed-not-data-driven","title":"数据知情，而非数据驱动","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-product-analytics/deciding-from-data/data-informed-not-data-driven","wordCount":2336,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲从数据做决策：在小样本现实下避免虚假精确、看明显的大信号、小步可逆地试，用质化（为什么）补充量化（什么）——量化定位问题、质化解释原因，并以「数据知情而非数据驱动」的成熟态度让数据增强而非取代判断与愿景。\n"}]}